<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Modules · KodoSchool</title>
<meta name="description" content="KodoSchool modules: marks, report cards, attendance, timetables, finance, library, laboratory, statistics, promotion and roles, all in one school system.">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/site-fonts.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/site.css?v=<%= locals.assetVersion || '' %>">
<style>
  /* ---------- modules page ---------- */
  .page-hero { position: relative; overflow: hidden; color: #fff; padding: 72px 0 70px;
               background: radial-gradient(900px 500px at 90% 0%, rgba(47,154,116,.35), transparent 60%), linear-gradient(180deg, var(--g-800), var(--g-900)); }
  .page-hero::after { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; opacity: .07; background-image: radial-gradient(#fff 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 22px 22px; }
  .page-hero .wrap { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .crumbs { font-size: 14px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.7); }
  .crumbs a:hover { color: #fff; }
  .page-hero h1 { font-size: clamp(38px, 5vw, 62px); line-height: 1.02; font-weight: 800; margin: 16px 0 0; max-width: 820px; }
  .page-hero h1 span { color: var(--gold); }
  .page-hero p { font-size: 19px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.82); max-width: 640px; margin: 20px 0 0; }
  .ov { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px; margin-top: 40px; }
  .ov a { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; padding: 16px; border-radius: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.07);
          border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14); transition: background .2s, transform .2s; }
  .ov a:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,.14); transform: translateY(-3px); }
  .ov .ic { width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 10px; background: var(--gold); color: var(--g-950); display: grid; place-items: center; }
  .ov .ic svg { width: 19px; height: 19px; }
  .ov b { font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.25; }

  .subnav { position: sticky; top: 68px; z-index: 30; background: rgba(245,248,246,.92); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .subnav .wrap { display: flex; gap: 6px; overflow-x: auto; padding-top: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; scrollbar-width: none; }
  .subnav .wrap::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
  .subnav a { flex: none; font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--muted); padding: 8px 14px; border-radius: 999px; transition: background .2s, color .2s; }
  .subnav a:hover { color: var(--g-800); background: var(--g-50); }
  .subnav a.on { background: var(--g-800); color: #fff; }

  .mod-sec { padding: 84px 0; scroll-margin-top: 120px; }
  .mod-sec:nth-of-type(even) { background: #fff; }
  .mod-sec .wrap { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 64px; align-items: center; }
  .mod-sec.flip .text { order: 2; }
  .mod-num { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
  .mod-num .ic { width: 50px; height: 50px; border-radius: 14px; background: var(--g-800); color: var(--gold); display: grid; place-items: center; box-shadow: 0 12px 24px -12px rgba(18,77,59,.8); }
  .mod-num .ic svg { width: 24px; height: 24px; }
  .mod-num small { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--g-700); letter-spacing: .02em; }
  .mod-sec h2 { font-size: clamp(28px, 3.4vw, 40px); margin-top: 18px; }
  .mod-sec .lead { margin-top: 12px; }
  .mod-sec .checks { margin: 24px 0; }
  .who { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; align-items: center; font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; }
  .who span { background: var(--g-50); color: var(--g-800); padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 700; }

  .visual { position: relative; }
  .visual::before { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 8% -4% -6% 10%; border-radius: 28px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--g-100), rgba(242,207,122,.25)); transform: rotate(2deg); }
  .mod-sec.flip .visual::before { transform: rotate(-2deg); inset: 8% 10% -6% -4%; }
  .mock { position: relative; background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: 0 30px 60px -30px rgba(11,46,35,.45); overflow: hidden; font-size: 14px; }
  .m-bar { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 12px 16px; background: var(--g-800); color: #fff; }
  .m-bar i { width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(255,255,255,.35); }
  .m-bar b { margin-left: 8px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
  .m-body { padding: 8px 18px 16px; }
  .m-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 11px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .m-row b, .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; white-space: nowrap; }
  .m-head { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .04em; }
  .m-cell { min-width: 74px; text-align: right; padding: 6px 10px; border: 1.5px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .m-cell.bad, .bad, .b-row .bad { color: var(--red); }
  .m-cell.focus { border-color: var(--g-700); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(27,107,82,.15); min-height: 33px; }
  .m-prog { margin-top: 14px; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--muted); }
  .m-sum { display: flex; gap: 18px; margin-top: 14px; font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--muted); }
  .m-sum b { color: var(--ink); } .m-sum .bad b { color: var(--red); }
  .m-total { font-weight: 700; }
  .m3 .m-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 96px; }
  .m3 .pill-s { text-align: center; }
  .pill-s { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .pill-s.p { background: var(--g-50); color: var(--g-800); }
  .pill-s.a { background: #fde8e8; color: var(--red); }
  .pill-s.l { background: #fdf1d3; color: #7a5a10; }
  .book { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
  .book i { width: 8px; height: 26px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--g-700); flex: none; }

  .paper { padding: 18px 20px; background: #fffef9; }
  .b-head { text-align: center; padding-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink); margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .b-head b { display: block; font-size: 12.5px; letter-spacing: .03em; }
  .b-head small { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }
  .b-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 50px 64px; padding: 9px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .b-row span:not(:first-child) { text-align: right; }
  .b-th { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--muted); }
  .b-foot { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 10px; margin-top: 14px; }
  .b-foot div { background: var(--g-50); border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px; text-align: center; }
  .b-foot small { display: block; font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--muted); }
  .b-foot b { font-family: var(--display); font-size: 20px; color: var(--g-800); }

  .tt { margin-top: 8px; }
  .tt-h, .tt-g { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 6px; }
  .tt-h span { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--muted); text-align: center; padding: 4px 0; }
  .tt-g .t { min-height: 44px; border-radius: 8px; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; background: var(--bg); color: var(--muted); text-align: center; padding: 2px; }
  .t.c1 { background: #dcefe6; color: #124d3b; } .t.c2 { background: #e3ecfb; color: #1f4fa8; } .t.c3 { background: #fdf1d3; color: #7a5a10; }
  .t.c4 { background: #e8f5e1; color: #3f7d3a; } .t.c5 { background: #f6e6ef; color: #8a2e5c; } .t.c6 { background: #efe8df; color: #6b4a2a; }

  .steps-s { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); margin-top: 18px; position: relative; }
  .steps-s::before { content: ""; position: absolute; top: 9px; left: 12%; right: 12%; height: 2px; background: var(--line); }
  .step-s { position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--muted); }
  .step-s i { width: 20px; height: 20px; border-radius: 50%; background: #fff; border: 2px solid var(--line); }
  .step-s.done i { background: var(--g-700); border-color: var(--g-700); }
  .step-s.now i { border-color: var(--gold-d); background: var(--gold); box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(242,207,122,.35); }
  .step-s.done, .step-s.now { color: var(--ink); }

  .st-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 110px 1fr 44px; gap: 12px; align-items: center; padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 13.5px; }
  .st-row b { text-align: right; }
  .st-bars { display: grid; gap: 4px; }
  .st-bars i { height: 8px; border-radius: 99px; display: block; }
  .girls { background: #2f9a74; } .boys { background: #e2b54a; }
  .legend { display: flex; gap: 16px; margin-top: 12px; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--muted); }
  .legend span { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
  .legend i { width: 12px; height: 8px; border-radius: 99px; display: inline-block; }

  .ac-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.6fr repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 4px; padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); align-items: center; font-size: 13px; }
  .ac-row span:not(:first-child) { text-align: center; }
  .ac-h { font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--muted); }
  .ac-row .y { color: var(--g-700); font-weight: 800; } .ac-row .n { color: #c3ccc8; }

  .mods-cta { padding: 80px 0 30px; }
  .mods-cta .box { text-align: center; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .mods-cta .box p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 18px; margin: 14px auto 28px; max-width: 560px; }
  .mods-cta .row { display: flex; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .btn-dark { background: var(--g-800); color: #fff; } .btn-dark:hover { background: var(--g-700); }
  .btn-line { border-color: var(--line); color: var(--ink); background: #fff; } .btn-line:hover { border-color: var(--g-700); }

  @media (max-width: 1020px) {
    .ov { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    .mod-sec .wrap { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }
    .mod-sec.flip .text { order: 0; }
    .visual { max-width: 560px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .ov { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    .mod-sec { padding: 64px 0; }
    .st-row { grid-template-columns: 90px 1fr 40px; }
    .ac-row { font-size: 11.5px; } .ac-h { font-size: 10px; }
    .m3 .m-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 84px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<%- include('partials/site-icons') %>

<!-- ================= NAV ================= -->
<%- include('partials/site-nav', { current: 'modules' }) %>
<main id="main" tabindex="-1">

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp; Modules</div>
    <h1>Ten modules. <span>One school record.</span></h1>
    <p>Every module works from the same students, classes, marks and payments. Enter something once and it appears everywhere it is needed, from the mark sheet to the report card to the parent's phone.</p>
    <div class="ov"><a href="#marks"><span class="ic"><svg><use href="#i-pen"/></svg></span><b>Marks &amp; sequences</b></a><a href="#report-cards"><span class="ic"><svg><use href="#i-file"/></svg></span><b>Report cards</b></a><a href="#attendance"><span class="ic"><svg><use href="#i-check"/></svg></span><b>Attendance &amp; discipline</b></a><a href="#timetables"><span class="ic"><svg><use href="#i-cal"/></svg></span><b>Timetables</b></a><a href="#finance"><span class="ic"><svg><use href="#i-wallet"/></svg></span><b>Finance &amp; fees</b></a><a href="#library"><span class="ic"><svg><use href="#i-book"/></svg></span><b>Library</b></a><a href="#laboratory"><span class="ic"><svg><use href="#i-flask"/></svg></span><b>Laboratory</b></a><a href="#statistics"><span class="ic"><svg><use href="#i-chart"/></svg></span><b>Statistics &amp; reports</b></a><a href="#promotion"><span class="ic"><svg><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></span><b>Promotion</b></a><a href="#access"><span class="ic"><svg><use href="#i-shield"/></svg></span><b>Roles &amp; access</b></a></div>
  </div>
</section>
<nav class="subnav" aria-label="Modules"><div class="wrap"><a href="#marks">Marks &amp; sequences</a><a href="#report-cards">Report cards</a><a href="#attendance">Attendance &amp; discipline</a><a href="#timetables">Timetables</a><a href="#finance">Finance &amp; fees</a><a href="#library">Library</a><a href="#laboratory">Laboratory</a><a href="#statistics">Statistics &amp; reports</a><a href="#promotion">Promotion</a><a href="#access">Roles &amp; access</a></div></nav>
<section class="mod-sec" id="marks">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="text">
      <div class="mod-num"><span class="ic"><svg><use href="#i-pen"/></svg></span><small>Module 1 of 10 · Teachers enter marks once</small></div>
      <h2>Marks &amp; sequences</h2>
      <p class="lead">Teachers enter sequence marks out of 20 on a clean mark sheet, on a phone or a computer. Averages, ranks and class statistics update by themselves.</p>
      <ul class="checks"><li>Mark sheet per class, subject and sequence</li><li>Entry limited to 0–20, with marks under 10 in red</li><li>Progress bars show which sheets are still incomplete</li><li>Marks lock when the term is published</li></ul>
      <div class="who">Used by <span>Teachers</span><span>Heads of department</span><span>Administration</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="visual" aria-hidden="true"><div class="mock"><div class="m-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>Form 3 · Mathematics · Seq. 3</b></div>
          <div class="m-body"><div class="m-row m-head"><span>Student</span><span>Mark / 20</span></div><div class="m-row"><span>Abena N.</span><span class="m-cell ">14.50</span></div><div class="m-row"><span>Brice T.</span><span class="m-cell bad">08.00</span></div><div class="m-row"><span>Carine M.</span><span class="m-cell ">16.00</span></div><div class="m-row"><span>David E.</span><span class="m-cell ">11.75</span></div><div class="m-row"><span>Esther K.</span><span class="m-cell focus"></span></div>
          <div class="m-prog"><span>4 of 5 entered</span><div class="bar"><i style="width:80%"></i></div></div></div></div></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="mod-sec flip" id="report-cards">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="text">
      <div class="mod-num"><span class="ic"><svg><use href="#i-file"/></svg></span><small>Module 2 of 10 · Bulletins in one click</small></div>
      <h2>Report cards</h2>
      <p class="lead">Bilingual bulletins with coefficients, averages, ranks, absences and class council remarks, for one student or the whole class at once.</p>
      <ul class="checks"><li>Weighted averages and ranks, exactly as on the bulletin</li><li>Term and annual averages with the term history</li><li>Discipline record and council remarks included</li><li>Print or send as PDF, one page per student</li></ul>
      <div class="who">Used by <span>Administration</span><span>Class masters</span><span>Parents</span><span>Students</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="visual" aria-hidden="true"><div class="mock paper"><div class="b-head"><b>STUDENT REPORT CARD | BULLETIN DE NOTES</b><small>Third term · Form 1A</small></div>
          <div class="b-row b-th"><span>Subject</span><span>Coef</span><span>Avg</span></div><div class="b-row"><span>Mathematics</span><span>5</span><span class="">16.00</span></div><div class="b-row"><span>English Language</span><span>5</span><span class="">17.00</span></div><div class="b-row"><span>Biology</span><span>3</span><span class="bad">4.50</span></div><div class="b-row"><span>Physics</span><span>3</span><span class="">19.00</span></div>
          <div class="b-foot"><div><small>Term average</small><b>13.38</b></div><div><small>Position</small><b>1 / 52</b></div><div><small>Council</small><b>GOOD</b></div></div></div></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="mod-sec" id="attendance">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="text">
      <div class="mod-num"><span class="ic"><svg><use href="#i-check"/></svg></span><small>Module 3 of 10 · A register for every lesson</small></div>
      <h2>Attendance &amp; discipline</h2>
      <p class="lead">Teachers take the register lesson by lesson. The discipline master follows absences, lateness and justifications, and parents see them the same day.</p>
      <ul class="checks"><li>Register on the phone in a few taps</li><li>Absences and lateness counted in hours</li><li>Justifications, warnings and suspensions</li><li>Term totals carried onto the report card</li></ul>
      <div class="who">Used by <span>Teachers</span><span>Discipline masters</span><span>Parents</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="visual" aria-hidden="true"><div class="mock"><div class="m-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>Register · 08:00 · Form 3</b></div>
          <div class="m-body"><div class="m-row"><span>Abena N.</span><span class="pill-s p">Present</span></div><div class="m-row"><span>Brice T.</span><span class="pill-s a">Absent</span></div><div class="m-row"><span>Carine M.</span><span class="pill-s p">Present</span></div><div class="m-row"><span>David E.</span><span class="pill-s l">Late</span></div><div class="m-row"><span>Esther K.</span><span class="pill-s p">Present</span></div><div class="m-sum"><span><b>41</b> present</span><span class="bad"><b>3</b> absent</span><span><b>1</b> late</span></div></div></div></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="mod-sec flip" id="timetables">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="text">
      <div class="mod-num"><span class="ic"><svg><use href="#i-cal"/></svg></span><small>Module 4 of 10 · Generated, then adjusted</small></div>
      <h2>Timetables</h2>
      <p class="lead">Generate a full timetable for every class and teacher from subjects, hours and coefficients, then adjust it by hand.</p>
      <ul class="checks"><li>Generated for all classes at once</li><li>No teacher in two places at the same time</li><li>Each teacher and class sees their own week</li><li>Feeds the registers lesson by lesson</li></ul>
      <div class="who">Used by <span>Administration</span><span>Teachers</span><span>Students</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="visual" aria-hidden="true"><div class="mock"><div class="m-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>Form 3A · Week</b></div>
          <div class="m-body"><div class="tt"><div class="tt-h"><span>Mon</span><span>Tue</span><span>Wed</span><span>Thu</span><span>Fri</span></div><div class="tt-g"><span class="t c1">Maths</span><span class="t c2">English</span><span class="t c3">Physics</span><span class="t c1">Maths</span><span class="t c5">French</span><span class="t c4">Biology</span><span class="t c1">Maths</span><span class="t c6">History</span><span class="t c3">Chemistry</span><span class="t c1">Maths</span><span class="t "></span><span class="t c6">Geography</span><span class="t c4">Sport</span><span class="t c2">English</span><span class="t c2">Computer</span><span class="t c5">French</span><span class="t c5">Citizenship</span><span class="t c1">Maths</span><span class="t "></span><span class="t c4">Biology</span></div></div></div></div></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="mod-sec" id="finance">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="text">
      <div class="mod-num"><span class="ic"><svg><use href="#i-wallet"/></svg></span><small>Module 5 of 10 · Every franc accounted for</small></div>
      <h2>Finance &amp; fees</h2>
      <p class="lead">Charge a class or a student, record payments in XAF, print numbered receipts and see who still owes, class by class.</p>
      <ul class="checks"><li>School fees, PTA and other charges</li><li>Numbered receipts, printed or shared</li><li>Outstanding balances by class and student</li><li>Parents see their balance on the phone</li></ul>
      <div class="who">Used by <span>Bursar</span><span>Administration</span><span>Parents</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="visual" aria-hidden="true"><div class="mock"><div class="m-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>Receipt Nº 2026-0418</b></div>
          <div class="m-body"><div class="m-row"><span>School fees · 1st instalment</span><b>25,000 XAF</b></div>
          <div class="m-row"><span>PTA levy</span><b>5,000 XAF</b></div>
          <div class="m-row m-total"><span>Paid today</span><b>30,000 XAF</b></div>
          <div class="m-prog"><span>Year paid: 60,000 of 75,000 XAF</span><div class="bar"><i style="width:80%;background:#e2b54a"></i></div></div>
          <div class="m-sum"><span>Balance</span><span class="bad"><b>15,000 XAF</b></span></div></div></div></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="mod-sec flip" id="library">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="text">
      <div class="mod-num"><span class="ic"><svg><use href="#i-book"/></svg></span><small>Module 6 of 10 · Loans and due dates</small></div>
      <h2>Library</h2>
      <p class="lead">Catalogue the library, lend books to students and staff, and follow due dates. Students and parents see what is on loan.</p>
      <ul class="checks"><li>Catalogue with copies and shelf places</li><li>Loans and returns in a few taps</li><li>Overdue list for the librarian</li><li>Loans shown in student and parent accounts</li></ul>
      <div class="who">Used by <span>Librarian</span><span>Students</span><span>Parents</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="visual" aria-hidden="true"><div class="mock"><div class="m-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>Library · Loans</b></div>
          <div class="m-body"><div class="m-row"><span class="book"><i></i>Things Fall Apart</span><span class="pill-s p">Due Fri</span></div><div class="m-row"><span class="book"><i></i>Physics, Form 3</span><span class="pill-s p">Due Mon</span></div><div class="m-row"><span class="book"><i></i>Le Vieux Nègre et la Médaille</span><span class="pill-s a">2 days late</span></div><div class="m-sum"><span><b>126</b> on loan</span><span><b>14</b> due today</span></div></div></div></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="mod-sec" id="laboratory">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="text">
