      <h2>Statistics &amp; reports</h2>
      <p class="lead">Results by class, subject and gender, ready for class councils, end-of-term reports and inspections.</p>
      <ul class="checks"><li>Sat, passed and % passed for girls and boys</li><li>Best and weakest subjects per class</li><li>Reports for class masters and heads of department</li><li>Export for official end-of-term returns</li></ul>
